OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, A demonstration model of a blowpipe
OL,6, surface-to-air missile has been stolen
OL,7, in County Down, Northern Ireland.
OL,8,F
OL,9,FThe missile was taken from a
OL,10,Fterritorial army centre at Newtownards.
OL,12,FThe Army says the model was used for
OL,13,Ftraining and cannot be made
OL,14,Foperational.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FPolice are investigating the theft,
OL,17,Fwhich happened overnight.
OL,18,F
OL,19,F
OL,20,F
OL,21,F
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
