PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1776025044
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G14/24
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The Law Lords have begun hearing
OL,6, Lonrho's appeal in the Harrods
OL,7, takeover row.
OL,9,FLonrho has gone to the Lords in an
OL,10,Fattempt to force the Government to
OL,11,Fpublish the Department of Trade and
OL,12,FIndustry's report on the takeover.
OL,14,FThe Lords have also been considering
OL,15,Fthe issue of whether Lonrho was in
OL,16,Fcontempt of court in sending the judges
OL,17,Fcopies of an Observer special issue
OL,18,Fcontaining details of the DTI report.
OL,20,FLonrho has said the material was sent
OL,21,Fto the judges by mistake.
